OL,3,GNEWSAMen held in major incident near
OL,4,ARAF Fairford as homes evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major incident has been declared and
OL,7,Fhomes have been evacuated in a village
OL,8,Fnear an RAF base which hosts the United
OL,9,FStates Air Force (USAF).
OL,11,FSeveral men have been arrested on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of offences under the
OL,13,FExplosives Act, police said. An army
OL,14,Fexplosive ordnance disposal team is
OL,15,Fcurrently examining a number of
OL,16,Fvehicles.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
