OL,3,GNEWSAMen held in major incident near
OL,4,ARAF Fairford as homes evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Whelford, Gloucestershire,
OL,7,Fhave been taken to a leisure centre
OL,8,Fwhile investigations continue, police
OL,9,Fsaid. A cordon is currently in place in
OL,10,Fthe area and officers say they believe
OL,11,Fthe incident is contained.
OL,13,FThe base has been recently used to
OL,14,Fdeploy USAF bombers since the country's
OL,15,Fconflict in Iran began in February.
